  AP {1..13} (tight, non-DC)         DC=False has-14-mult=False  min_i||v_i/14|| = 1/14 = 0.0714  <- t=1/14 gives 1/14
  GW {1..11,13,24} (tight, non-DC)   DC=False has-14-mult=False  min_i||v_i/14|| = 1/14 = 0.0714  <- t=1/14 gives 1/14
