UNIFIED PICTURE / CORRECTION of kps cont.52
================================================================================
  kps mechanism (CORRECT): DC => t=1/14 blocked => coarser witness => M > 1/14.
  kps extremization (BACKWARDS): 'worst DC bottoms at q=24 => 1/12'. FALSE.
  band-edge ceil(q/14)/q DECREASES in q => M is MINIMIZED by the family stuck at the
  LARGEST q. The deep well {1..12,182} clears ONLY at q=183 (182=13*14 blocks every small q),
